n></figure><figure><img alt=\"「湯英伸事件」（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220326/584403204629204992631782.png/IerhsboXIRHUnjZQm3kdNNO_4Q7Thsgx1mlbwNZpW8A\"/><figcaption>「湯英伸事件」（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「湯英伸事件」（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220326/584403207233998848653107.png/naEMNnJj_ePvDGqUGRyH_oI82BhdpuzTQ6UoqkOlKKo\"/><figcaption>「湯英伸事件」（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"左圖為湯英伸的哥哥，右圖為湯英伸當時緊握的十字架項鍊。（ETtoday授權使用）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220326/584403209478082560960281.jpeg/7Cw1yuJmmMNJLOKy5ODkV-tCFnoqrlOpi9SVkYvUlZE\"/><figcaption>左圖為湯英伸的哥哥，右圖為湯英伸當時緊握的十字架項鍊。（ETtoday授權使用）</figcaption></figure><p>延伸閲讀：</p><p>影音／蠢賊偷特斯拉「整片車窗扯下來」　哨兵模式錄下正臉讓警秒逮人</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-15T11:20:14.502651+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2222,"images":28,"source":"HK01 中國","fallback":"none"}}